{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Well-favored of flesh and beautiful of form.</b> And above it mentioned יפות מראה ובריאות בשר, and so the wording changes in some of the terms, for Pharaoh does not recount his dream to Joseph exactly as he saw it and as the Torah testified in the narrative above. Therefore our Rabbis of blessed memory interpreted: Joseph said to him, 'You did not see בריאות בשר ויפות תואר but rather יפות מראה ובריאות בשר. You did not see דלות ורעות תואר but rather רעות מראה ודקות בשר. You did not see מלאות וטובות but rather בריאות וטובות. You did not see צנומות but rather דקות ושדופות קדים.' Pharaoh was astonished and said, 'You were indeed in my dream,' as it says אחרי הודיע אלהים וגו׳. This is what his father blesses him (Genesis 49:22): בן פרת יוסף בן פרת עלי עין, among the cows."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:19:22.057427496Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}